  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chucarosaurus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Chucarosaurus\">Chucarosaurus diripienda</a></i> showing known fossil material. An unfigured partial right tibia and indeterminate metapodial (belonging to the holotype) are not shown. Scale bar=1 m.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(MPCA PV 820)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#C93443\" title=\"#C93443\"> </b>=Paratype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(MPCA PV 821)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cretres.2023.105487\">\"A new giant titanosaur (Dinosauria, Sauropoda) from the Upper Cretaceous of Northwestern Patagonia, Argentina\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/srep19165\">\"A gigantic new dinosaur from Argentina and the evolution of the sauropod hind foot\"</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bonitasaura_salgadoi_Skeletal.png\" title=\"File:Bonitasaura salgadoi Skeletal.png\"> <i>Bonitasaura</i> skeletal</a> by Gunnar Bivens</li></ul>",
